The bug was caused by improper management of floating objects in the context, leading to a crash when accessing or finalizing these objects without proper registration and unregistration. Specifically, the previous implementation did not register the `rb_column` as a floating object, which could result in it being prematurely garbage collected or not properly cleaned up, causing instability in the application.

